  <item>
    <title>Vol. 01 要啥自行车</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64986a4ad6cdb5972856d5ec</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">64986a4ad6cdb5972856d5ec</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 25 Jun 2023 16:24:39 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>Hey，欢迎收听荒野播客！</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期我们来了一位嘉宾 -爱骑行的老赵</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目分享了许多骑行中的有趣、难忘的经历，以及5年来是如何从“早餐油条配啤酒的宅男逐渐成为自律健康的骑行达人的。</span></p><span></span><p><span>除此之外节目中还非常接地气的介绍了很多骑行专业小知识及购买装备需要注意的那些事儿。</span></p><span></span><p><span>对骑行感兴趣的小伙伴听这期就对了！</span></p><span></span><p><span>- Shownotes -</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://podcaster.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcasts/638695aa882ce82fb64593a8/create/undefined" data-url="https://podcaster.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcasts/638695aa882ce82fb64593a8/create/undefined"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="478">00:07:58</a></span></a><span> 如何爱上的自行车骑行</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://podcaster.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcasts/638695aa882ce82fb64593a8/create/undefined" data-url="https://podcaster.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcasts/638695aa882ce82fb64593a8/create/undefined"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1150">00:19:10</a></span></a><span> 骑行中难忘经历</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://podcaster.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcasts/638695aa882ce82fb64593a8/create/undefined" data-url="https://podcaster.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcasts/638695aa882ce82fb64593a8/create/undefined"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1230">00:20:30</a> </span></a><span>首次妙峰山骑拉了胯了</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://podcaster.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcasts/638695aa882ce82fb64593a8/create/undefined" data-url="https://podcaster.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcasts/638695aa882ce82fb64593a8/create/undefined"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1454">00:24:14</a></span></a><span> 从小白到专业</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://podcaster.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcasts/638695aa882ce82fb64593a8/create/undefined" data-url="https://podcaster.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcasts/638695aa882ce82fb64593a8/create/undefined"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1854">00:30:54</a> </span></a><span>骑行中遇到突发状况怎么办</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://podcaster.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcasts/638695aa882ce82fb64593a8/create/undefined" data-url="https://podcaster.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcasts/638695aa882ce82fb64593a8/create/undefined"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2114">00:35:14</a> </span></a><span>二刷妙峰山不同的感受</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://podcaster.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcasts/638695aa882ce82fb64593a8/create/undefined" data-url="https://podcaster.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcasts/638695aa882ce82fb64593a8/create/undefined"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2954">00:49:14</a> </span></a><span>骑行中结识同好</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://podcaster.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcasts/638695aa882ce82fb64593a8/create/undefined" data-url="https://podcaster.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcasts/638695aa882ce82fb64593a8/create/undefined"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3130">00:52:10</a> </span></a><span>骑行中遇到的危险以及需要注意的安全事项</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://podcaster.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcasts/638695aa882ce82fb64593a8/create/undefined" data-url="https://podcaster.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcasts/638695aa882ce82fb64593a8/create/undefined"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3220">00:53:40</a></span></a><span> 购买自行车前必须知道的那些事儿</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://podcaster.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcasts/638695aa882ce82fb64593a8/create/undefined" data-url="https://podcaster.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcasts/638695aa882ce82fb64593a8/create/undefined"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3474">00:57:54</a></span></a><span> 骑行装备选购须知</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://podcaster.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcasts/638695aa882ce82fb64593a8/create/undefined" data-url="https://podcaster.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcasts/638695aa882ce82fb64593a8/create/undefined"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4654">01:17:34</a></span></a><span> 北京周边骑行路线推荐</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://podcaster.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcasts/638695aa882ce82fb64593a8/create/undefined" data-url="https://podcaster.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcasts/638695aa882ce82fb64593a8/create/undefined"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4860">01:21:00</a></span></a><span> 如何找到骑行同号伙伴，加入骑行圈子</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM LIST｜Light My Fire/ The Doors</span></p><span></span><p><span>Joker/ X Japan</span></p><span></span><p><span>-本期嘉宾-</span></p><span></span><p><span>老赵：设计师，骑行重度爱好者。</span></p><span></span><p><span>- 主播 -</span></p><span></span><p><span>花伦</span></p><span></span><p><span>隔壁老王</span></p><span></span><p><span>- 收听方式 -</span></p><span></span><p><span>在各音频平台及任意泛用型播客客户端搜索「荒野播客」收听订阅。</span></p>]]></description>
